<view class="page">
  <view class="title">个人中心</view>

  <view class="info-card">
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-label">顾客编号</text>
      <text class="info-value mono">{{customerId}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="info-label">角色</text>
      <text class="info-value">{{roleLabel}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    <text>手机号仅以哈希形式存储，无法在此查看明文。如需换绑请联系店主。</text>
  </view>

  <button class="logout-btn" type="warn" bindtap="onLogout">退出登录</button>
</view>
